    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d307-a4">

                <pb facs="0700" n="652" xml:id="pg652"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Consular Agency of the United States
                                of America</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Hiogo,
                            Japan,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-02-08"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 8, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>On this eighth day of February, A. D. 1868, before me, Paul Frank, consular agent
                    of the United States of America for Hiogo and the dependencies thereof, duly
                    appointed, personally appeared A. Marks, H. Marks, and L. Marks, to me
                    personally known to be the persons described in and who executed this statement,
                    and who acknowledged to me that they executed the same freely and voluntarily to
                    and for the uses and purposes therein named.</p>
                <p>Given under my hand and the seal of this consular agency the day and year in this
                    certificate first above written.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">[seal.]</hi> PAUL FRANK, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">United States Consular Agent.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
